{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1784762353322209943,"compiled_state":{"alias":"engaging-edacious-meadowhawk","assignee":"Joe Oakhart","author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"bb2bb2612a365958652f9a73615e0333c540a5b397b40e699e2f69b663696ea0","event_uuid":"4cc80bf8-0183-4797-86f8-3a811dc98773","position":{"commit_sha":"a4bdfc4fbc2ae98ae91a9c628f7ee4d3907899dd","position":"1784761483450792001-4cc80bf8-0183-4797-86f8-3a811dc98773"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"70041fd752adee8523436b0f6f8fa0191b6822536c00c59bf93de62378118926","event_uuid":"0cebae6c-bb18-43a4-8826-45c99b783203","position":{"commit_sha":"ed5304d3714f944da90d7301ce6cb357dcfc4fdb","position":"1784761491403614001-0cebae6c-bb18-43a4-8826-45c99b783203"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"c1c55fe40cbb22c836aea632226f800a0cc74220bf11acbe1fea8324a51ec5aa","event_uuid":"e941d962-ef1f-4a32-b23f-ff48374de993","position":{"commit_sha":"ed5304d3714f944da90d7301ce6cb357dcfc4fdb","position":"1784761491765128001-e941d962-ef1f-4a32-b23f-ff48374de993"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"25e0ac3d7b5d156712391cb8b6b231bbcb2e63ff33760e0685b190deab3c7b3a","event_uuid":"24fb1719-1621-4aef-aea7-5e5fecef8408","position":{"commit_sha":"e4d2a6c3f67ce0212bc411802cda171474a238d9","position":"1784762353322209942-24fb1719-1621-4aef-aea7-5e5fecef8408"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-218_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"c85c122f-abd5-42a2-b149-a7cff1cc6853","comments":[],"created_at":1784761483450792001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## What\nThe LLM runner sends no sampling temperature (`runner.py` model_settings carried only cache\nflags, max_tokens, timeout), so every review call — including the Pass-2 finding VERIFIER — runs\nat the provider default temperature with no seed. The verifier's narrow yes/no `binary` +\n`severity_attributes` are the ONLY inputs to the kernel's `priority = validity x impact`, so\nre-sampling them on an identical input flips impact/validity and therefore the block/advisory\ndecision. Proven from stored client sidecars: the same finding, same plan, no edits, scored\n`impact 0.85 / priority 0.74 / BLOCK` on one run and `impact 0.0 / priority 0.0 / advisory` on\nthe next. Upstream review-code report §2.\n\n## Approach\nAdd a `temperature` field to `LLMConfig` (default None = provider default, byte-unchanged; env\n`REBAR_LLM_TEMPERATURE`). Apply it in the runner's `model_settings`, with a per-request\n`RunRequest.config.temperature` override winning over the runner cfg (mirrors the existing\nmax_tokens seam). Add a per-step `with: temperature` input honored in `workflow/runs.py`\n(the v3 step schema is closed; `with` is the open extension, exactly like `step_budget_per_item`).\nPin `temperature: 0` (greedy) on the Pass-2 verify steps: code-review.yaml verify, plan-review.yaml\nBOTH verify-branch arms, and the hand-built plan-review Pass-2 novelty sub-call. This is a\nREPRODUCIBILITY floor for gate integrity, not a correctness fix.\n\n## Scope / files\n- `src/rebar/llm/config.py` — `temperature` field + from_env + widen `_llm_float` default to\n  `float | None`.\n- `src/rebar/llm/runner.py` — apply temperature to model_settings.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/runs.py` — honor `with: temperature`.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/gates/code-review.yaml`, `plan-review.yaml` — `temperature: 0` on verify.\n- `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/__init__.py` — greedy on the Pass-2 novelty sub-call.\n- `tests/unit/test_llm_temperature.py` — new.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- `LLMConfig().temperature is None`; `REBAR_LLM_TEMPERATURE=0` -> 0.0; unparseable -> None.\n- Runner omits `temperature` from model_settings when None (unchanged default); sets it when\n  configured; a per-request config.temperature overrides the runner cfg.\n- A workflow step with `with: {temperature: 0}` builds its RunRequest under cfg.temperature == 0.\n- lint, typecheck, and the workflow/config/verify suites stay green.\n\n## Out of scope\nThe single-pass completion-verifier gate (not four-pass Pass-2) is a natural sibling but left for a\nfollow-up. Correctness of narrow verification questions (a temperature-sweep robustness eval) is a\nseparate improvement.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"0cebae6c-bb18-43a4-8826-45c99b783203","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"620b-343d-47e0-4b3a","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Pass-2 verifier samples at provider-default temperature; re-runs flip block/advisory","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["4cc80bf8-0183-4797-86f8-3a811dc98773","0cebae6c-bb18-43a4-8826-45c99b783203","e941d962-ef1f-4a32-b23f-ff48374de993","24fb1719-1621-4aef-aea7-5e5fecef8408"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1784762353322209943,"uuid":"f1d3f59a-b00a-435e-b241-63f82966c58c"}